# Copy to .sanitize-denylist (gitignored) and add the terms YOUR fork must
# never publish: customer names, colleague names, internal project codenames,
# vendor account handles.
#
# One term per line, case-insensitive, matched as a plain substring with NO
# word boundaries, so "acme" also catches "acme_engager_queued" and
# "Acme_TAM_Top200_v1".
#
# This file is an example. The real list is deliberately never committed,
# because a public denylist of client names leaks the client names.

